@startuml
skinparam defaultFontName "Noto Sans CJK SC"
skinparam shadowing false
hide footbox

participant "voimed\nSenseVoice Preview + Final" as Daemon
participant "voime-gpu\nFinal optional" as Worker
participant "模型包" as Package

Daemon -> Package : 读取 manifest / 校验 SHA
note right of Daemon
  Partial 始终由 SenseVoice 处理，
  不进入 voime-gpu
end note
alt Final 是 CPU SenseVoice
  Daemon -> Daemon : 不启动 worker
else Final 是 GPU FireRed
  Daemon -> Worker : spawn + Hello(manifest, device)
  Worker -> Worker : 加载 FireRed AED FP16
  Worker --> Daemon : Ready(capabilities)
  Daemon -> Worker : Transcribe(final segment, PCM f32)
  Worker --> Daemon : Final raw text
  Daemon -> Daemon : SenseVoice Preview / VAD / Punc 继续
end
alt worker 崩溃 / 超时 / 显存不足
  Daemon -> Daemon : 退避重启 worker
  Daemon -> Daemon : 失败则 Final 回退 CPU SenseVoice 或报错
end
Daemon -> Worker : Shutdown（如已启动）
@enduml
